OL,3,ATop UN court begins judgment on whether
OL,4,AMyanmar committed genocide against
OL,5,ARohingya
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe ruling is being watched closely for
OL,8,Fany repercussions it might have on
OL,9,Fother genocide cases, including one
OL,10,Fbrought by South Africa against Israel
OL,11,Fover the war in Gaza. Israel has called
OL,12,Fthat case "wholly unfounded" and based
OL,13,Fon "biased and false claims"
OL,15,FNo state has ever been found guilty by
OL,16,Fan international court of committing
OL,17,Fgenocide
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
